      {
        "id": 23275945,
        "name": "eightbit",
        "username": "eightbit-2783247",
        "avatar_template": "/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png",
        "created_at": "2024-04-02T18:50:44.164Z",
        "cooked": "<p>AI could help with up-rezzing some of the ancient pixelated textures.</p>\n<p>And could be handy to add voice lines for races/NPCs when the original VA is dead or sounds very different 15 years later. Like a tauren DH would need a generated “not enough fury” error speech because that was never recorded back in the day.</p>\n<p>For writing or things that I suspect he means are “busy work”? Hellll no. AI has two settings: boring and accurate, or bafflingly wrong.</p>",
